    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Service Status",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "#E02F44",
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "#9FC119",
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#E02F44",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#9FC119",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"epricing-service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Service",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Prometheus Scrape Reachability (`up{job=\"epricing-service\"}`)**\n\nIndicates whether Prometheus can successfully scrape `http://epricing-service:8081/actuator/prometheus` every 10s.\n\n- **Green (`UP` / `1`):** Actuator management port `:8081` is healthy and responding.\n- **Red (`DOWN` / `0`):** Container crashed, hung, or unreachable (`EPricingServiceDown` critical alert fires after `1m`)."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Total Requests (All Time)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#9FC119",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pricing_requests_total{application=\"epricing-service\",type=\"all\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Total",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Cumulative Pricing Requests Received (`pricing_requests_total{type=\"all\"}`)**\n\nCustom Micrometer counter incremented at entry to `PricingService.calculatePricing()` for both sync REST calls and Temporal `calculateAndPersistPricing` activities.\n\n- **Note:** Resets to `0` if `epricing-service` restarts; use `rate()` or `increase()` graphs for restart-safe throughput."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Successful Pricings",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
