      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pricing_requests_total{application=\"epricing-service\",type=\"success\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Success",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Cumulative Successful Pricing Calculations (`type=\"success\"`)**\n\nCount of requests since JVM startup that passed all 3 statutory gates (credit score ≥ 650, LTI ≤ 10x, FOIR ≤ 50%) and committed atomically (`pricing_requests` + `pricing_audit_logs`) to YugabyteDB.\n\n- **Compare with:** *Total Requests* to eyeball approval yield vs rejections."
    },
