    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Active In-Flight Requests",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#9FC119",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "#E02F44",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pricing_requests_active{application=\"epricing-service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "In-Flight",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Live Concurrent In-Flight Pricing Requests (`pricing_requests_active`)**\n\nMicrometer `AtomicLong` gauge incremented on entering `PricingService.calculatePricing()` and decremented in its `finally` block.\n\n- **Green:** `< 20` (fast sub-10ms completion means gauge normally reads `0–2`)\n- **Yellow:** `20 – 49` (concurrency surge or slowing DB writes)\n- **Red:** `≥ 50` (`EPricingRequestBacklog` alert threshold—threads piling up on DB or downstream stalls)."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "CPU Utilization",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#9FC119",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "#E02F44",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_cpu_usage{application=\"epricing-service\"} * 100",
          "legendFormat": "CPU %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**JVM Process CPU Usage (`process_cpu_usage * 100`)**\n\nCPU percentage actively used by the `epricing-service` JVM process.\n\n- **Green:** `< 50%` | **Yellow:** `50% – 80%` | **Red:** `≥ 80%` (`EPricingHighCPU` alert fires after 5m)."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Heap Memory Used",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#9FC119",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 60
              },
              {
                "color": "#E02F44",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "clamp_min(sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{application=\"epricing-service\",area=\"heap\"}) / clamp_min(sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{application=\"epricing-service\",area=\"heap\"} > 0), 1) * 100, 0) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Heap %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**JVM Heap Memory Used % (`area=\"heap\"`)**\n\nPercentage of bounded G1GC Java heap currently occupied (`sum(used) / sum(max > 0) * 100`).\n\n- **Green:** `< 60%` | **Yellow:** `60% – 85%` | **Red:** `≥ 85%` (`EPricingHighHeapUsage` OOM risk alert)."
    },
