      ],
      "description": "**Active Checked-Out HikariCP DB Connections (`epricing-pool`)**\n\nNumber of database connections actively executing SQL queries at scrape time (`hikaricp_connections_active`).\n\n- **Green:** `< 7` | **Yellow:** `7 – 9` | **Red:** `≥ 10` (configured pool max is `20` in `application.yml`; sustained high values signal slow YugabyteDB queries)."
    },
