    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Request Rate (req/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"epricing-service\",outcome=\"SUCCESS\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Success req/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"epricing-service\",outcome=~\"CLIENT_ERROR|SERVER_ERROR\"}[1m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Error req/s",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**HTTP Throughput Rate by Outcome (req/s over 1m)**\n\nPer-second arrival rate of HTTP traffic split by Spring outcome:\n- **`SUCCESS`:** HTTP `2XX` responses (`201 Created`, `200 OK`, `202 Accepted`)\n- **`Errors`:** `CLIENT_ERROR` (`4XX` underwriting rejections/validation) + `SERVER_ERROR` (`5XX` crashes).\n\n- **Use:** Confirms steady ingress traffic (~0.17 req/s baseline from 6s `traffic-generator`) and spots sudden traffic drops or error spikes."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Response Time Percentiles",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"epricing-service\"}[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"epricing-service\"}[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"epricing-service\"}[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**End-to-End HTTP Latency Percentiles (`p50`, `p95`, `p99` in ms)**\n\nDistribution of total HTTP request duration computed from Micrometer histograms over a 5m rolling rate window across all endpoints.\n\n- **p50:** Typical median user experience.\n- **p95 (`EPricingHighLatency` alert if `> 2,000 ms`):** Tail latency experienced by the slowest 5% of calls.\n- **p99:** Worst 1% spikes (often reflects GC pauses, `/metrics-demo/simulate-slow` 800–1500ms runs, or DB locks)."
    },
