    {
      "id": 21,
      "title": "Requests by Product Type",
      "description": "**Loan Demand Mix by Product Type (`pricing_product_requests_total`)**\n\nCumulative request volume broken down by `product` label: `HOME_LOAN`, `PERSONAL_LOAN`, `BUSINESS_LOAN`, `AUTO_LOAN`, `EDUCATION_LOAN`.\n\n- **Use:** Tracks business mix; an unexpected `0` bar for one product usually signals a broken frontend product code or multiplier regression.",
