        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#9FC119",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#E5A000",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "#E02F44",
                "value": 200
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(pricing_calculation_duration_seconds_bucket{application=\"epricing-service\"}[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50 calc ms",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(pricing_calculation_duration_seconds_bucket{application=\"epricing-service\"}[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95 calc ms",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(pricing_calculation_duration_seconds_bucket{application=\"epricing-service\"}[5m])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p99 calc ms",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Core Financial Math Engine Latency SLA (`pricing_calculation_duration_seconds`)**\n\nMeasures **pure underwriting & BigDecimal rate/EMI math time** inside `PricingService`, excluding YugabyteDB commit and network time (`p50` / `p95` / `p99` in ms over `[5m]`).\n\n- **Green:** `< 50 ms` | **Yellow:** `50 – 200 ms` | **Red:** `≥ 200 ms` (indicates JVM CPU starvation or GC pause)."
    },
