          "legendFormat": "p99 (tail) ms",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Pricing Engine Calculation Duration Trend (`p50`, `p95`, `p99` ms)**\n\nTime-series view of pure in-JVM pricing calculation latency (`pricing_calculation_duration_seconds_bucket`).\n\n- **Diagnostic tip:** Compare this with *Response Time Percentiles* (`id=12`): if HTTP latency jumps while calculation duration stays `< 5 ms`, the slowdown is in **YugabyteDB I/O**, **HikariCP wait**, or `/metrics-demo/simulate-slow`—not math logic."
    },
