          "expr": "sum by (error_type) (pricing_errors_total{application=\"epricing-service\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{error_type}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Cumulative Application Errors Grouped by `error_type` (`pricing_errors_total`)**\n\nCounts every exception caught by `GlobalExceptionHandler`, labeled by exact machine code:\n- Business `422`: `PRICING_INSUFFICIENT_CREDIT_SCORE`, `PRICING_AMOUNT_EXCEEDS_ELIGIBILITY`, `PRICING_FOIR_EXCEEDED`\n- Client `400`: `VALIDATION_FAILED`, `MALFORMED_REQUEST_BODY`, `TEMPORAL_DISABLED`\n- Server `500`: `UNHANDLED_*`, `PRICING_CALCULATION_FAILED`.\n\n- **Note:** Excludes `pricing_demo_errors_total` so demo errors never pollute real alert error budgets."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "title": "4XX Errors (Client Errors)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
