      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"epricing-service\",status=~\"4..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "4XX Total",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Total HTTP `4XX` Client & Underwriting Rejections in Time Range**\n\nTotal `4XX` responses served across all endpoints during `$__range`. In this service, `422` underwriting rejections (`credit_score < 650` or `FOIR > 50%`) count as `4XX`.\n\n- **Green:** `0` | **Red:** `≥ 1` — Check *Errors by Type* (`id=31`) to distinguish expected loan denials from `VALIDATION_FAILED` bugs."
    },
