      "description": "**HTTP Error Rate Over Time (`4XX` vs `5XX` req/s)**\n\n1-minute rolling rate of `status=~\"4..\"` (policy rejections / bad inputs) alongside `status=~\"5..\"` (`EPricingHighErrorRate` fires if `5XX > 5%` for 3m).\n\n- **Healthy:** `5XX` flat at `0`; occasional `4XX` bumps match underwriting policy rejections."
