        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections_active{application=\"epricing-service\",pool=\"epricing-pool\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Active",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections_idle{application=\"epricing-service\",pool=\"epricing-pool\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Idle",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections_pending{application=\"epricing-service\",pool=\"epricing-pool\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Pending",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "hikaricp_connections_max{application=\"epricing-service\",pool=\"epricing-pool\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Max Pool Size",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**HikariCP Connection Pool Saturation (`epricing-pool`)**\n\nTracks pool health across 4 series:\n- `active`: currently running SQL queries\n- `idle`: warm connections ready in pool (min 5)\n- `pending`: threads blocked waiting for a free connection (must stay `0`)\n- `max`: configured `maximum-pool-size` (default `20` in `application.yml`).\n\n- **Action:** If `pending > 0` or `active` stays pinned at `max`, inspect YugabyteDB latency and `DB Connection Acquire Time`."
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "title": "DB Connection Acquire Time (ms)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 43
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(clamp_min(rate(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_sum{application=\"epricing-service\",pool=\"epricing-pool\"}[1m]) / clamp_min(rate(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_count{application=\"epricing-service\",pool=\"epricing-pool\"}[1m]), 0.0001) * 1000, 0)) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Avg Acquire ms",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds_max{application=\"epricing-service\",pool=\"epricing-pool\"} * 1000) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Max Acquire ms",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**HikariCP Connection Checkout Wait Time (`avg` & `max` in ms)**\n\nTime a thread waits for `HikariPool` to hand over a physical connection to YugabyteDB (`hikaricp_connections_acquire_seconds`).\n\n- **Healthy:** `< 5 ms`\n- **Warning:** `5 – 50 ms` (pool contention building)\n- **Critical:** `> 50 ms` (threads queuing behind slow DB commits or pool exhaustion)."
    },
