      "description": "**JVM Heap Memory Used vs Maximum Committed (`bytes`)**\n\nTracks G1GC heap allocation (`jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"}`) against bounded max heap (`> 0`). Look for a **healthy sawtooth pattern** (steady rise, sharp drop on GC).\n\n- **Unhealthy pattern:** Rising baseline floor approaching `max` across GC cycles indicates a memory leak or oversized `JAVA_OPTS` cache retention."
